It’s called “Pray from Fukushima.”
Put people's positive attitude with a bright and energetic melody that "I want to convey it from Fukushima".
Due to the impact of the new coronavirus, the live house, which is the base of music activities, was forced to close, and many of the musicians lost the place to sing and perform.
It was planned by singer-songwriter nappo (46), who lives in Minamisoma City, and DAZU-O (37), a member of Iwaki City's music group "Mehikari Boys", in order to believe in the power of music in order to believe in the power of music.
Mr. Nappo is in charge of lyrics and composition, and Mr. Dazuo is in charge of rapping.
