Mr. Nappo said, "It has become a luxurious face that can not be thought of in normal times. I want to enjoy this opportunity to the fullest."
There was no opportunity for sixteen people to gather as a measure against infection, each of which was recorded at a live house or at home.
In order to support the project, Iwaki City's painter Koa drew down the image character.
In the shape of Fukushima Prefecture, it expresses the climate rich in nature with blue and greenery.
The finished song will be transmitted to the world on YouTube, and the aim is to make it into a CD.
