About three-hundredry pieces of paper written by fans and local residents from all over the country are attached, and the city of hot water is enveloped with the light of yales to deliver healing to visitors.
The Bonbori Festival is an event that reproduces the festival that appears in the anime "Flower Blooming Iroha" modeled on Yuwaku Onsen, organized by the Yuwaku Onsen Tourism Association.
