98% reflection.
It turns out that white paint derived from Teflon-processed frying pan will enhance the cooling effect with insulation!
What a great discovery!
This year, it was a rainy season with an unprecedented amount of rainfall, but if it is bright, the hot summer will be in full swing.
It's hot and hot, and it's so hot that even the air-conditioning doesn't work... just imagine it, it's going to happen, doesn't it?
Global warming is a global problem, and humanity has been trying to figure out how to overcome the hot midsummer as comfortably as possible.
One way to do this is to wear dirty clothes.
You don't have to wear black clothes to absorb heat in the summer, do you?
In addition, it seems that more and more cases are applying the same principle to the architecture of the house and using white paint.
Even if white is white, it is not possible to use a paint that reflects more light and does not absorb heat, and that was the latest research field.
Henry Samueli School of Engineering and Applied Science at the University of California, Los Angeles (UCLA) recently announced that in collaboration with researchers at Columbia University's Faculty of Applied Physics and Applied Numbers, Columbia University has found the most efficient way to recover solar heat and improve the cooling effect inside the building.
It is expected that it will be put into practical use early.
Until now, white paint with the highest reflectivity of solar rays has been made using titanium oxide, which has a reflectivity of 85%.
The white paint, which already uses titanium oxide, is applied to the roof of a building in a high-temperature environment to cut off solar heat to improve cooling efficiency.
However, what has been newly discovered is white paint derived from polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) fluorine resin, which is used in tefflon-processed frying pans.
It is a white paint that applies the Teffron effect, reflecting the sun's rays up to nearly 98%, making it possible to significantly cut heat.
Even in the hot summer, thanks to white paint using Teffron unexpectedly, it is easy to spend indoors without being exposed to extreme heat.
Maybe those times are coming soon, aren’t they?
I feel that the roof of Japanese houses has a lot of dark colors, but from now on, the white system will become the mainstream?
When is Amazon’s annual sale coming up this year?
Amazon.com has announced the postponement of its “Prime Day” annual sale, CNBC reported on July 21st.
It is held in July every year, but it was said that it was forced to be postponed this year due to the spread of the new coronavirus infection.
A spokeswoman said: “Details will be announced soon,” an Amazon spokesperson said in a statement.
“Prime Day has become a special celebratory event that we’ve been looking forward to over the past five years. This year we’re going to make sure our employees are safe, supporting our customers and our exhibitors, and we’re going to do it later than usual.”
However, he said, “The details will be announced soon,” and did not disclose the specific date.
On the other hand, it was decided to hold a meeting in India.
A press release has been posted on the country's website.
He explained that it will run for 48 hours from midnight on August 6.
Prime Day has been held worldwide at the same time so far, but this year it may take unusual measures.
Amazon has launched a large-scale sale for its members as a measure to promote sales in the summer when sales are declining.
It was initially a 24-hour event, but it has grown year-over-year, and last year it took place in 18 countries, including the U.S., Canada, the U.K., Germany, France, India, Japan, China, and Australia.
According to the company, sales for the past two days exceeded the previous sales results of “Black Friday” (the first day of year-end sales) and “Cyber Monday” (the following Monday).
This event also contributed to the acquisition of new subscribers of paid members "Prime", and last year, the number of applications for the first day was the highest on record as the number of days, and there was also a number after that the next day.
Last year, it sold 175 million products worldwide.
Internet Retail, an online shopping magazine, reported that global sales over a two-day period increased by seventy percent year-on-year to seventy-six million dollars.
Mobile phone number transfer, severe eyes for excessive retention.
What are the fees and points?
(NEW SWITCH) - Yahoo! News
The Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications (MIC) is in full swing considering the review of the same number transfer system (MNP), which can use the conventional telephone number as it is when changing the mobile telecommunications company.
At a meeting of experts on the 21st, he indicated a policy to revise the guidelines of the MNP established in 2004.
There are a wide range of specific issues, such as the nature of MNP fees and the pros and cons of retiring those who wish to move out.
While a backlash from telecommunications companies is also expected, attention will be focused on whether it can lead to the promotion of healthy market competition.
The darkness of the telecommunications companies where all-you-can-change mobile phones are far away The user-pay fee was 2000yen at the beginning of this year when MNP was introduced, but now it is 3000yen.
MNP commission revenue from the three major mobile telecommunications giants is estimated to amount to JPY159 billion per year.
On the 21st, the Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications listed the current situation surrounding MNP at a meeting of experts on the competitive environment of the telecommunications market, the Working Group on the Verification of Competition Rules.
He also pointed out the amount of MNP reservation numbers that consumers need when they move to other telecommunications companies.
Major telecommunications companies are accepting it on the web, but due to the convenience of the operation of the core system, the acceptance time is mainstream from nine to twenty o'clock.
In the WG materials, it was clearly stated that as the direction of future consideration, it would be in principle to respond throughout the day.
For those who wish to move out of MNP, it is also a problem for mobile communication companies to keep them, such as by granting points.
Excessive restraint can hinder fair competition.
"With permission from the user to obtain permission from the user, we will promptly issue the number and terminate it. It is important to thoroughly implement this process first," said Shunichi Kita of the Nomura Research Institute, a member of the WG.
However, in a series of a series of issues, there is a structural problem such as “The higher the level, the harder it is for customers to leak out, so it is difficult to actively motivate them to lower” (person in charge of the Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications).
There is also a concern that if there are businesses that take the initiative to lower MNP fees, the outflow of customers from the company will increase, and corporate efforts will not be rewarded.
The Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications has also pointed out that many countries overseas do not ask for a user-based fee for MNP, and it is possible that this will be the case in Japan.
The Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications (MIC) would like to summarize the results of the WG as a report around September-October, after which it would like to begin the procedure for the revision of the MNP guidelines.
The timing of the amendment is expected to be after twenty-one years.
It seems that mobile telecommunications companies are likely to worry about their heads, including the way of sales and customer support.
