In 1994, there was an incident in which a Ferrari Mondial was stolen in the Netherlands.
Time had passed, but after twenty-six years it miraculously was discovered.
Ferrari discovered at the bottom of the river (four points in the photo) The discovery was triggered by diving training at the fire department.
On July 8th, a diver in training discovered something of a wedge-shape sinking at the bottom of the river, and even the police and the Dutch went out and pulled it up, and it was a Ferrari Mondial.
