The car is handed over to its legal owner, the insurance company, and then sent to a scrap dealer.
“There are still a few remaining parts, but it’s for the art of decorating. We’ve already received a lot of requests from people who want to make a table from a disjointed mondial, we’re using engine blocks and glass plates.”
